Student Tracker 

Student Tracker is a simple, full-stack demo app for managing classes, enrollments, attendance, and private messages between instructors and students. It includes a Node.js + Express backend with PostgreSQL, and a clean, role-aware frontend built with static HTML/CSS/vanilla JS. 

This repository contains a complete local development setup, plus Docker-friendly artifacts for easier deployments. 

 

